 hormone-free whey protein (we do not use synthetic hormones to treat the cows such as rBST & rBGH) with a unique array of amino acids, the building blocks of skin, hair, nails, muscles, that help your body function normally, and even your immune system. Whey protein is especially beneficial for active lifestyles."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Naturemax Energize Whey Protein (Non-GMO) is a hormone-free whey protein (we do not use synthetic hormones to treat the cows such as rBST & rBGH) with a unique array of amino acids, the building blocks of skin, hair, nails, muscles, that help your body function normally, and even your immune system.\r\nGluten Free\r\nNon-GMO Whey Protein"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Higher Branched Chain Amino Acids (BCAAs)"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"As a dietary supplement for weight support combine Naturemax Energize with Maxi Thin Supreme, D&S Control and Maxi Green Tea Concentrate.\r\nDirections: As a dietary supplement, add one measuring scoop (included) of Maxi Whey Protein to 8 fl. oz. (or more) of cold skim milk, whole milk or juice, once daily, or as directed by a qualified healthcare professional. (For best results use blender or mixer.)"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\r\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Kosher","notes":"UK (Rav Shmuel Dovid Krausz (Udvarer Rav)) (Kosher)\r\nBDZ Edah Charedis - Orthodox Council of Jerusalem (Kosher)\r\nOU D (Dairy) (Kosher)"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"UK (Rav Shmuel Dovid Krausz (Udvarer Rav)) (Kosher)\r\nBDZ Edah Charedis - Orthodox Council of Jerusalem (Kosher)\r\nOU D (Dairy) (Kosher)"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Questions? info@maxihealth.com"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Unflavored\r\nWhey Protein"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"